Hi Marisa,

Questions about glmmTMB are better for the R-sig-mixed list
https://stat.ethz.ch/mailman/listinfo/r-sig-mixed-models

I’m guessing that the coefficients are large because I(stthr.std^2) is small when stthr.std is in [-1, 1].

As for the NAs in the model fits, there should be convergence warnings or errors accompanying them. The messages should refer to vignette("troubleshooting"). Can you give a reproducible example?

cheers,
Mollie

